  "description": "ILogger provider that ships error logs to the Sppro Api Logger service. Crash-safe: never throws to the host, even if the formatter, options, or shipper fail — and from 0.3.1, neither does any other registered logging provider. Multi-targets net48, net6.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
  "frameworkAssemblyGroup": {
    "@id": "https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2026.05.01.02.26.21/spproapilogger.client.0.3.1.json#frameworkassemblygroup/.netframework4.8",
